# The classic X11 pointer of amadeOS: a cursor theme without cursors. As the system's default cursor theme
# (the x-cursor-theme alternative, set by this package) it lets libXcursor fall back to X's own cursors, so
# installing dmz-cursor-theme for Settings > Accessibility does not change the pointer of everyone.
[Icon Theme]
Name=amadeOS classic
Comment=The classic X11 pointer
